##Reset password

POST:/admin/reset_password
แก้ไขรหัสผ่าน

###Input
INPUT:admin_id,required|int,admin ID
INPUT:reset_password_token,required|string,Token from forgot password
INPUT:password,required|string,New Password

##Error
ERROR:SUCCESS
ERROR:REQUIRE_PARAMETER
ERROR:INVALID_FORMAT

###RESULT
JSON:module/admin/document/admin/login_success

